an>(</span><span>uri</span><span>.</span><span>getScheme</span><span>()))</span><span> </span><span>{</span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span> </span><span>return</span><span> </span><span>getDataColumn</span><span>(</span><span>context</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>uri</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>null</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>null</span><span>);</span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span> </span><span>}</span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span> </span><span>// File</span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span> </span><span>else</span><span> </span><span>if</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>&quot;file&quot;</span><span>.</span><span>equalsIgnoreCase</span><span>(</span><span>uri</span><span>.</span><span>getScheme</span><span>()))</span><span> </span><span>{</span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span> </span><span>return</span><span> </span><span>uri</span><span>.</span><span>getPath</span><span>();</span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span> </span><span>}</span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span> </span><span>return</span><span> </span><span>null</span><span>;</span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span> </span><span>}</span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span>\n</span></span></span><span><span><span></span><span>}</span><span>\n</span></span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>\n</div>\n</div><p>再有，即使获取的结果为null，也要传给web，即直接调用<code>mUploadMessage.onReceiveValue(null)</code>,否则网页会阻塞。</p>\n<p>最后，在打release包的时候，因为我们会混淆，要特别设置不要混淆WebChromeClient子类里面的openFileChooser方法，由于不是继承的方法，所以默认会被混淆，然后就无法选择文件了。</p>\n<p>就这样吧。</p><p><h4><a href=\"https://isming.me/2015-12-21-android-webview-upload-file/?utm_source=rss#commentsanchor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">看完评论一下吧<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></h4></p>",
